---
import LandingPageImage from "../components/LandingPageImage.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <LandingPageImage progressiveBlur={true} />
  <main>
    <div id="about" class="flex split-screen-container">
      <p class="flex">
        <span
          >Madeline is a Chicago-based DJ, curator, and producer whose work sits
          at the heart of the city’s house and techno underground. Their sets
          are atmospheric and sensual, centered around vocal-forward selections
          and jacking acid basslines that channel the spirit of Midwest dance
          floors while venturing into ambient, bass music, industrial, and 90s
          gay anthems. With a deep respect for the lineage of house and techno,
          Madeline crafts journeys that balance emotional depth with driving,
          hypnotic rhythm.</span
        >
        <span>
          Originally from the Bay Area, Madeline has become a defining presence
          within the city’s queer and electronic music communities over the last
          15 years. Their deep musical knowledge is rooted in years of community
          engagement and crate-digging, cultivated over a decade of hosting
          radio on WNUR 89.3 FM and a stint at the historic Gramaphone Records.
          Madeline is a long-standing resident at the legendary Smartbar, where
          they invite selectors who share their reverence for both classic
          genres and risk-taking versatility at their quarterly party Statement
          Piece.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../styles/layout.scss" as *;

  #about {
    height: 100%;
    color: white;
    overflow: scroll;

    p {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: $space-xs;
      margin: 11dvh $space-lg;
    }
  }
</style>
